close_comment = "Both advisory mitigations are on main: GHSA-mjjc-9pq8-vv3w by the recipient check before any debit at sdk/x/staking/keeper/delegation.go:905 with the assertions at delegation_test.go:335, and GHSA-fhhj-6jhx-mwph by the initial delegatecall guard at precompiles/spot/vault.go:64 with the assertions at vault_test.go:398 and :412. This issue closes on that evidence (decision 3117). Answering the two private advisories and restoring the security contact SECURITY.md names remain owner actions scheduled after the 7.0.0 upgrade; they are tracked outside this issue and no engineering task waits on them."
